{
  "id": "NUM.32",
  "number": "32",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Numbers 32",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tribes of Reuben and Gad had a lot of livestock. When they saw how suitable the land of Jazer and Gilead was for cattle, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they went to Moses, Eleazar, and the other leaders of the community and said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“This region which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3+NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3",
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has helped the Israelites to occupy — the towns of Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sibmah, Nebo, and Beon — is good land for livestock, and we have so much livestock. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3+NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3",
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Please give us this land as our property, and do not make us cross the River Jordan and settle there.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses replied, “Do you want to stay here while your fellow-Israelites go to war? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How dare you try to discourage the people of Israel from crossing the Jordan into the land which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has given them? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 13.17–33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is what your fathers did when I sent them from Kadesh Barnea to explore the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They went as far as the Valley of Eshcol and saw the land, but when they returned, they discouraged the people from entering the land which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had given them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 14.26–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was angry that day and made a promise: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘I swear that because they did not remain loyal to me, none of the men twenty years old or older who came out of Egypt will enter the land that I promised to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This included everyone, except Caleb son of Jephunneh the Kenizzite and Joshua son of Nun; they remained loyal to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was angry with the people and made them wander in the wilderness for forty years until that whole generation that had displeased him was dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now you have taken your fathers' place, a new generation of sinful men ready to bring down the fierce anger of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " on Israel again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you people of Reuben and Gad refuse to follow him now, he will once again abandon all these people in the wilderness, and you will be responsible for their destruction.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They approached Moses and said, “First, allow us to build stone enclosures here for our sheep and fortified towns for our dependants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then we will be ready to go with our fellow-Israelites into battle and lead the attack until we have settled them in the land that will be theirs. In the meantime, our dependants can live here in the fortified towns, safe from the people of this land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We will not return to our homes until all the other Israelites have taken possession of the land assigned to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We will not take possession of any property among them on the other side of the Jordan, because we have received our share here east of the Jordan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses answered, “If you really mean what you say, then here in the presence of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " get ready to go into battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All your fighting men are to cross the Jordan and under the command of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " they are to attack our enemies until the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " defeats them ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and takes possession of the land. After that, you may return, because you will have fulfilled your obligation to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and to your fellow-Israelites. Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will acknowledge that this land east of the Jordan is yours. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if you do not keep your promise, I warn you that you will be sinning against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Make no mistake about it; you will be punished for your sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So build your towns and the enclosures for your sheep, but do what you have promised!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The men of Gad and Reuben said, “Sir, we will do as you command. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our wives and children and our cattle and sheep will remain here in the towns of Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But all of us are ready to go into battle under the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s command. We will cross the Jordan and fight, just as you have said.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 1.12–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses gave these commands to Eleazar, Joshua, and the other leaders of Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If the men of Gad and Reuben cross the Jordan ready for battle at the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s command and if with their help you are able to conquer the land, then give them the land of Gilead as their property. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if they do not cross the Jordan and go into battle with you, they are to receive their share of the property in the land of Canaan, as you do.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The men of Gad and Reuben answered, “Sir, we will do as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Under his command we will cross into the land of Canaan and go into battle, so that we can retain our property here east of the Jordan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses assigned to the tribes of Gad and Reuben and to half the tribe of Manasseh all the territory of King Sihon of the Amorites and King Og of Bashan, including the towns and the country round them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tribe of Gad rebuilt the fortified towns of Dibon, Ataroth, Aroer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atroth Shophan, Jazer, Jogbehah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth Nimrah, and Beth Haran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tribe of Reuben rebuilt Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebo, Baal Meon (this name was changed), and Sibmah. They gave new names to the towns they rebuilt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The clan of Machir son of Manasseh invaded the land of Gilead, occupied it, and drove out the Amorites who were there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses gave Gilead to the clan of Machir, and they lived there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jair, of the tribe of Manasseh, attacked and captured some villages and named them “Villages of Jair”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobah attacked and captured Kenath and its villages, and he renamed it Nobah, after himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
